---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: Blog
description: Writing by Md Ariful Islam on AI systems, automation, and building reliable software.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="section__title">Blog</h1>
    <p class="section__subtitle">
      Notes on AI systems, automation, and lessons from building in production.
    </p>

    {% if collections.posts | length %}
    <div class="post-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="blog__empty">No posts yet — check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
